{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>A terumah to HaShem.</b> I do not know how much. I apply a analogy: it says here תרומה, and it says regarding terumat maaser תרומה — just as terumat maaser is one part in ten, so too this is one part in ten." "<b>To the priest who dashes the blood of the shelamim, to him it shall be.</b> And the remainder is eaten by the owners."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {0 "Reading the abbreviated numerals א׳ מי׳ as אחד מעשר (one part in ten)."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:29.831314509Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}